> Cropped skips and learned up-convolutions

U-Net contracts through two3x3 ReLU convolutions and2x2 pooling per level,
then expands with learned2x2 stride2 transposed convolutions. Each decoder
concatenates its upsampled features with the floor-centred cropped encoder
skip before another convolution pair. For odd excess sizes, extra pixels
remain on the bottom/right. The crop differentiates source pixels only;
reference tensor values merely supply the requested shape.

Original valid-pair geometry maps572 pixels to388, with four pooling levels
and base64 channels. The compact model uses base8,SAME pairs,RGB/four classes
and no dropout; sides divisible by16 retain their size. The full architecture
has dropout.5 at the deepest encoder and bottleneck during training. Up-convolution
weights are learned, unlike FCN's frozen bilinear filters.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/unet_crop.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>

#include <print>
int main() {
  namespace n = dm::nn;
  namespace m = n::models;
  auto source = n::arange(0, 7 * 9).reshape({1, 7, 9, 1}).requires_grad_();
  const auto crop = m::UnetCenterCropTo(source, n::zeros({1, 4, 6, 2}));
  const auto g = n::grad(n::sum(crop), {source})[0];
  for (int r = 0; r < 7; ++r)
    for (int c = 0; c < 9; ++c) {
      const double expected = r >= 1 && r < 5 && c >= 1 && c < 7 ? 1 : 0;
      if (g.at({0, r, c, 0}) != expected)
        return 1;
    }
  if (crop.at({0, 0, 0, 0}) != 10 || m::UnetOutputSide(572) != 388 ||
      m::UnetOutputSide(188) != 4)
    return 1;
  auto a = n::plot_tensor_map(n::reverse(source.detach().reshape({7, 9}), {0}), 0, 62),
       b = n::plot_tensor_map(n::reverse(g.reshape({7, 9}), {0}), 0, 1);
  a.title("Known7 by9 skip values");
  b.title("Crop gradient footprint");
  std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
  dm::graphics::RLayout::create(1, 2).add(a).add(b).size(1200, 550).fit_panels().save_svg(
      "build/unet_crop.svg");
  std::print("Floor-centred7x9->4x6 crop starts row1,column1;all63 source derivatives exact. "
             "Original572->388 and executable188->4 geometry pass.\n");
}
```
