\caption(All compact U-Net encoder,decoder,up-convolution and class-score leaves fit 256 visible Adam updates. Validation mean IoU selects the checkpoint; there is no BN state.)
\alttext(All compact U-Net encoder,decoder,up-convolution and class-score leaves fit 256 visible Adam updates. Validation mean IoU selects the checkpoint; there is no BN state.)

The compact model has 485,844 learned scalars. Validation mean IoU is still rising
at the last epoch, so epoch 16 is selected with validation mean IoU .564009; test pixel
accuracy is .923299 and mean IoU .629215. Background IoU is .998191, but circle IoU is
only .288039, compared with .628234 for rectangles and .602395 for triangles. High pixel
accuracy therefore does not imply equally strong foreground-class recognition, and this
short fit has not converged.

