> Conclusion

Exact crop derivatives and full original graph checks precede compact whole-model fitting. Actual shape masks,fit-only weights and validation-selected restoration make the held-out results reproducible without implying a biomedical benchmark.

> References

- [Ronneberger,Fischer and Brox(2015), U-Net: Convolutional Networks for Biomedical Image Segmentation](https://arxiv.org/abs/1505.04597).
